{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26195","headline":"留别吉州太守宗人迈 · 滕倪","name":"留别吉州太守宗人迈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋初江上别旌旗，故国无家泪欲垂。\n千里未知投足处，前程便是听猨时。\n误攻文字身空老，却返渔樵计已迟。\n羽翼雕零飞不得，丹霄无路接差池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"滕倪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}